I took the original poster's advice, and came up with some interesting light
bulbs jokes using his 'ncode' program.  Here are some of my results:


How many DEC repairmen did it take to leave a light bulb alone?
How many cats does it take to screw in a light bulb?
How many <ethnic group> would it take to screw up a light bulb?
How many hamsters would it take to leave a light bulb alone?
How many policemen did it take to leave a light bulb alone?
How many dogs would it take to think of these stupid jokes?
How many mathematicians did it take to screw in a light bulb?
How many cats would it take to screw in a light bulb?
How many Jewish Mothers would it take to think of these stupid jokes?
How many light bulbs did it take to think up these stupid jokes?

The last one's a kicker, eh?

